  "question": {
    "text": "A tangent to the curve, <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> meets <math><mi>x</mi></math>-axis at <mrow><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> </mrow> and <math><mi>y</mi></math>-axis at <mrow><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></math> and <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the curve also passes through the point</mrow>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "1kAa0",
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
